#. Description of the plugin
#: thai-address-autocomplete-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Suggests Thai subdistrict, district, province and postcode as customers type, and fills the address fields. Works with block and classic checkout and My Account. Data ships with the plugin; nothing is sent to third parties."
msgstr ""

